{"kind": "coverage", "sut": "MissionLoopUnitBuilder", "sut_file": "Source/Parsek/MissionLoopUnitBuilder.cs", "sut_line": 1178, "case_kind": "integration", "proposed_name": "MissionLoopUnitBuilder_ParkingConicEndUT_IsDescentRunEndPlusCaptureShift", "sketch": "Build a re-aim mission loop unit from a descent run with a known EndUT and a known negative captureShift; assert the emitted LoopUnit.ParkingConicEndUT == descentRun.EndUT + captureShift (not the unshifted EndUT).", "guards": "The 0ba10f594 frame-mismatch regression: an unshifted ParkingConicEndUT makes the loiter-gap clamp compare a shifted loop clock against a recorded-frame bound, so the parking conic stops rendering.", "risk": "playback"}
